  "description": "This is a cookbook put together by employees, residents and friends of the Ellendale Nursing Center (later Prince of Peace / Benedictine Community - Ellendale) in the mid 1980s.  The book does not contain a publication date, but the latest date indicated in the introduction is 1984.  The Garfield picture on the cover also helps place it in that era.   KEYWORDS: Ellendale Nursing Center, Ellendale, North Dakota, Nursing Homes, Dickey County, Cookbooks, Recipes",
